/ wait for a cancelled task fails as Cancelled.
Start
- goal.call(Name="Slow", Parallel=true); variable.set(Name=%task%, Value=%!data%)
- task.cancel(Task=%task%)
- task.wait(Task=%task%); on.error(Recovery=[goal.call(Name="Caught")])
- assert.equals(Expected="Cancelled", Actual=%caught%, Message="a wait on a cancelled task fails as Cancelled")

Slow
- timer.sleep(Duration="2s")

Caught
- variable.set(Name=%caught%, Value=%!error.Key%)
